Otaeh
$cards
DECK 1 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 6 ROTATE 1 U 2
GAIMAD 4 FACE_ALL
GAIMAD 3 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE DRAW GAIMAD
AND
    OR
        DEST Size >= 9
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES}
    OR
        SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, CLUBS, HEARTS, SPADES}
        DESTSRC Suit alternate_color
MOVE GAIMAD GAIMAD
SRC Rank K
MOVE_STACK GAIMAD GAIMAD
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
        DEST Size > 2
    AND
        SRC Rank 1
        SRC Rank 1
$win
PILE ALL DRAW Empty
